## 6.3 AI Learning Assistant (RAG)

### Capabilities

* Answer questions from uploaded PDFs
* Explain concepts in simple language
* Provide real-world examples
* Support follow-up questions
* Generate educational flowcharts
* Maintain conversational context
* Continue previous discussions
* Provide additional educational information when requested

### Example

**User:** Explain normalization in simple words.

**AI Assistant:**

> Imagine a school library where the same book details are written on every shelf. Normalization is the process of organizing information so that the same data is not repeated unnecessarily.

